# Paste a token from POST /api/v1/auth/login (never commit real tokens)
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products

### Get Single Product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/16

### Create new Product
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "my book in programming",
  "description": "Description about my book in programming",
  "price": 8
}

### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/19
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "price": 16
}

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### (admin) Add images to a product (up to 5 files per request, 8 per product)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/1/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="images"; filename="photo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./photo.png
--Boundary--

### (admin) Remove one image of a product (publicId comes from the product's images)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/1/images
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "publicId": "products/PASTE_PUBLIC_ID" }

### Reviews of a product (public, newest first, paginated)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/products/1/reviews?page=1&limit=10
